From: TrinityXSX <trinityxsx@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] TrinityXSX: add PNG cover art, per-game xcl.toml editor, and
 Web Companion QR

Decode PNG logos from MicrosoftGame.config in pure Rust (miniz_oxide),
render a right-side game preview panel with saves summary and version
badge, add a DualSense per-game xcl.toml settings editor (R1/Options),
and add a PIN-protected LAN Web Companion with QR code (L1) for one-tap
trinityxsx-logs.zip download and browser config editing.
